# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Here, we'll generate a TwoLocal circuit and define some observables.\n"
msgstr ""
"Di sini, kita akan jana Circuit TwoLocal dan tentukan beberapa boleh "
"cerap.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Input: Parameters to create a circuit</li>\n"
"    <li>Output: Abstract circuit and observables</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"We consider a hardware-efficient `entangler map` for the TwoLocal circuit with periodic connectivity between the last and the first qubits of the `entangler map`. This long range interaction can lead to extra SWAP gates during transpilation, thus increasing the depth of the circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Input: Parameter untuk cipta Circuit</li>\n"
"    <li>Output: Circuit abstrak dan boleh cerap</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"Kita tengok `entangler map` yang cekap perkakasan untuk Circuit TwoLocal dengan ketersambungan berkala antara Qubit terakhir dan pertama dalam `entangler map`. Interaksi jarak jauh ni boleh menyebabkan Gate SWAP tambahan semasa transpilasi, lalu menambah kedalaman Circuit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Select backend and initial layout {#select-backend-and-initial-layout}"
msgstr ""
"Pilih Backend dan susun atur awal {#select-backend-and-initial-layout}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For this notebook we shall consider a 109 qubit periodic 1D chain, which is "
"the longest 1D chain in the topology of a 127-qubit IBM Quantum device. It "
"is not possible to arrange a 109 qubit periodic chain on a 127 qubit device "
"such that the first and last qubits are neighbors without incorporating "
"extra SWAP gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk notebook ni kita akan guna rantai 1D berkala 109 Qubit, iaitu rantai "
"1D terpanjang dalam topologi peranti IBM Quantum 127-Qubit. Tak mungkin nak "
"susun rantai berkala 109 Qubit pada peranti 127 Qubit supaya Qubit pertama "
"dan terakhir jadi jiran tanpa menambah Gate SWAP tambahan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Build the entangler map for the TwoLocal circuit {#build-the-entangler-map-"
"for-the-twolocal-circuit}"
msgstr ""
"Bina entangler map untuk Circuit TwoLocal {#build-the-entangler-map-for-the-"
"twolocal-circuit}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"TwoLocal circuit allows the repetition of the `rotation_blocks` and the "
"`entangler map` multiple times. For this case, the number of repetitions "
"determine the number of periodic gates that need to be cut. Since the "
"sampling overhead increases exponentially with the number of cuts (refer to "
"the [Wire cutting for expectation values estimation](/tutorials/wire-"
"cutting) tutorial for more details), we shall fix the number of repetitions "
"to 2 in this notebook.\n"
msgstr ""
"Circuit TwoLocal membenarkan pengulangan `rotation_blocks` dan `entangler "
"map` beberapa kali. Untuk kes ini, bilangan pengulangan menentukan bilangan "
"Gate berkala yang perlu dipotong. Memandangkan overhed pensampelan meningkat"
" secara eksponen dengan bilangan potongan (rujuk tutorial [Pemotongan wayar "
"untuk anggaran nilai jangkaan](/tutorials/wire-cutting) untuk maklumat "
"lanjut), kita tetapkan bilangan pengulangan kepada 2 dalam notebook ni.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/periodic-"
"boundary-conditions-with-circuit-cutting/extracted-"
"outputs/79428537-66cf-40ce-87cf-0f75f591cb4b-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/periodic-"
"boundary-conditions-with-circuit-cutting/extracted-"
"outputs/79428537-66cf-40ce-87cf-0f75f591cb4b-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In order to verify the quality of the outcome using circuit cutting, we need"
" to know the ideal outcome. The current circuit of choice is beyond brute "
"force classical simulation. Therefore, we fix the parameters to the circuit "
"carefully to make it clifford.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk sahkan kualiti hasil menggunakan circuit cutting, kita perlu tahu "
"hasil yang ideal. Circuit yang dipilih sekarang ni melangkaui simulasi "
"klasik secara kasar. Oleh itu, kita tetapkan parameter Circuit dengan teliti"
" supaya jadi clifford.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We shall assign the parameter value $0$ for the first two layers of `Rx` "
"gates, and the value $\\pi$ for the last layer. This ensures that the ideal "
"outcome of this circuit is $|1\\rangle^{\\otimes n}$, $n$ being the number "
"of qubits. Therefore, the expectation values of $\\langle Z_i \\rangle$ and "
"$\\langle Z_i Z_{i+1} \\rangle$, where $i$ is the index of the qubit, are "
"$-1$ and $+1$ respectively.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan tetapkan nilai parameter $0$ untuk dua lapisan pertama Gate `Rx`, "
"dan nilai $\\pi$ untuk lapisan terakhir. Ini memastikan hasil ideal Circuit "
"ni adalah $|1\\rangle^{\\otimes n}$, dengan $n$ ialah bilangan Qubit. Oleh "
"itu, nilai jangkaan $\\langle Z_i \\rangle$ dan $\\langle Z_i Z_{i+1} "
"\\rangle$, di mana $i$ ialah indeks Qubit, masing-masing ialah $-1$ dan "
"$+1$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Select observables {#select-observables}"
msgstr "Pilih boleh cerap {#select-observables}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To quantify the benefits of gate cutting we measure the expectation values "
"of the observables $\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^n \\langle Z_i \\rangle$ and "
"$\\frac{1}{n-1}\\sum_{i=1}^{n-1} \\langle Z_i Z_{i+1} \\rangle$. As "
"discussed before, the ideal expectation values are $-1$ and $+1$ "
"respectively.\n"
msgstr ""
"Untuk ukur manfaat gate cutting, kita ukur nilai jangkaan boleh cerap "
"$\\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^n \\langle Z_i \\rangle$ dan "
"$\\frac{1}{n-1}\\sum_{i=1}^{n-1} \\langle Z_i Z_{i+1} \\rangle$. Seperti "
"yang dibincangkan sebelum ni, nilai jangkaan ideal ialah $-1$ dan $+1$ "
"masing-masing.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 2: Optimize problem for quantum hardware execution {#step-2-optimize-"
"problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 2: Optimumkan masalah untuk pelaksanaan perkakasan kuantum "
"{#step-2-optimize-problem-for-quantum-hardware-execution}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Input: Abstract circuit and observables</li>\n"
"    <li>Output: Target circuit and observables produced by cutting long range gates</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
msgstr ""
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Input: Circuit dan boleh ukur (observable) yang abstrak</li>\n"
"    <li>Output: Circuit sasaran dan boleh ukur yang dihasilkan dengan memotong gate jarak jauh</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the circuit {#transpile-the-circuit}"
msgstr "Transpile Circuit tersebut {#transpile-the-circuit}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that the circuit can be transpiled at this stage, or after cutting. If "
"we transpile after cutting, that will require us to transpile each of the "
"subexperiments generated due to the sampling overhead. Therefore, it is more"
" prudent to transpile at this stage to reduce the overhead of "
"transpilation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perlu diingat bahawa circuit boleh di-transpile pada peringkat ini, atau "
"selepas pemotongan. Kalau kita transpile selepas pemotongan, kita perlu "
"transpile setiap subeksperimen yang terhasil akibat overhead pensampelan. "
"Oleh itu, lebih bijak untuk transpile pada peringkat ini bagi mengurangkan "
"overhead transpilasi.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"However, if transpilation is done at this stage with native hardware "
"connectivity, the transpiler will append multiple SWAP gates to place the "
"periodic 2-qubit operation – obfuscating the benefits of circuit cutting. To"
" avoid this problem we can leverage that we know the exact gates that needs "
"to be cut. Specifically, we can create a virtual coupling map by adding "
"virtual connections between far away qubits to accommodate these periodic "
"2-qubit gates. This will ensure that the circuit can be transpiled at this "
"stage without incorporating the extra SWAP gates.\n"
msgstr ""
"Walau bagaimanapun, jika transpilasi dilakukan pada peringkat ini dengan "
"ketersambungan perkakasan asli, Transpiler akan menambahkan beberapa gate "
"SWAP untuk menempatkan operasi 2-Qubit berkala — yang akan mengaburkan "
"faedah pemotong circuit. Untuk elakkan masalah ini, kita boleh manfaatkan "
"pengetahuan kita tentang gate yang tepat yang perlu dipotong. Khususnya, "
"kita boleh cipta peta pasangan maya dengan menambah sambungan maya antara "
"Qubit yang jauh bagi menampung gate 2-Qubit berkala ini. Ini akan memastikan"
" circuit boleh di-transpile pada peringkat ini tanpa memasukkan gate SWAP "
"tambahan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/periodic-"
"boundary-conditions-with-circuit-cutting/extracted-"
"outputs/ad38aa32-4613-46c5-bf62-da332a1b9dfb-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/periodic-"
"boundary-conditions-with-circuit-cutting/extracted-"
"outputs/ad38aa32-4613-46c5-bf62-da332a1b9dfb-0.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Cut the long range periodic connectivities {#cut-the-long-range-periodic-"
"connectivities}"
msgstr ""
"Potong ketersambungan berkala jarak jauh {#cut-the-long-range-periodic-"
"connectivities}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Now we cut the gates in the transpiled circuit. Note that the 2-qubit gates "
"that need to be cut are the ones connecting the last and the first qubits of"
" the layout.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sekarang kita potong gate dalam circuit yang sudah di-transpile. Perlu "
"diingat bahawa gate 2-Qubit yang perlu dipotong ialah gate yang "
"menghubungkan Qubit pertama dan terakhir dalam susun atur.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "We shall apply the layout of the transpiled circuit to the observable.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan menggunakan susun atur circuit yang telah di-transpile ke atas "
"boleh ukur tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Finally the subexperiments are generated by sampling over different "
"measurement and preparation bases.\n"
msgstr ""
"Akhirnya, subeksperimen dijana dengan membuat pensampelan ke atas pelbagai "
"asas pengukuran dan persediaan.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that cutting the long range interactions leads to the execution of "
"multiple samples of the circuit that differ in the measurement and "
"preparation bases. More information about this can be found in <a "
"href='https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.07534'>Constructing a virtual two-qubit "
"gate by sampling single-qubit operations</a> and <a "
"href='https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.11638'>Cutting circuits with multiple two-"
"qubit unitaries</a>.\n"
msgstr ""
"Perlu diingat bahawa pemotongan interaksi jarak jauh menghasilkan "
"pelaksanaan pelbagai sampel circuit yang berbeza dalam asas pengukuran dan "
"persediaan. Maklumat lanjut tentang ini boleh didapati dalam <a "
"href='https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.07534'>Constructing a virtual two-qubit "
"gate by sampling single-qubit operations</a> dan <a "
"href='https://arxiv.org/abs/2312.11638'>Cutting circuits with multiple two-"
"qubit unitaries</a>.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The number of periodic gates to be cut is equal to the number of repetitions"
" of the `TwoLocal` layer, defined as `num_reps` above. The sampling overhead"
" of gate cutting is 6. Therefore, the total number of subexperiments will be"
" $6^{num\\_reps}$.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bilangan gate berkala yang perlu dipotong adalah sama dengan bilangan "
"pengulangan lapisan `TwoLocal`, yang ditakrifkan sebagai `num_reps` di atas."
" Overhead pensampelan pemotongan gate ialah 6. Oleh itu, jumlah bilangan "
"subeksperimen ialah $6^{num\\_reps}$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile the subexperiments {#transpile-the-subexperiments}"
msgstr "Transpile subeksperimen {#transpile-the-subexperiments}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At this point, the subexperiments contains circuits with some 1-qubit gates "
"that are not in the basis gate set. This is because the cut qubits are "
"measured in different basis, and the rotation gates used for this does not "
"necessarily belong to the basis gate set. For example, measurement in X "
"basis implies applying a Hadamard gate before the usual measurement in Z "
"basis. But Hadamard is not a part of the basis gate set.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pada ketika ini, subeksperimen mengandungi circuit dengan beberapa gate "
"1-Qubit yang tidak berada dalam set gate asas. Ini kerana Qubit yang "
"dipotong diukur dalam asas yang berbeza, dan gate putaran yang digunakan "
"untuk ini tidak semestinya tergolong dalam set gate asas. Contohnya, "
"pengukuran dalam asas X bermakna menggunakan gate Hadamard sebelum "
"pengukuran biasa dalam asas Z. Tetapi Hadamard bukan sebahagian daripada set"
" gate asas.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instead of applying the entire transpilation process on each of the circuits"
" in the subexperiments, we can use specific transpilation passes. Refer to "
"<a href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_passes\">this "
"documentation</a> for a detailed description of all the available "
"transpilation passes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Daripada menggunakan keseluruhan proses transpilasi pada setiap circuit "
"dalam subeksperimen, kita boleh menggunakan laluan transpilasi tertentu. "
"Rujuk <a "
"href=\"https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/transpiler_passes\">dokumentasi"
" ini</a> untuk penerangan terperinci tentang semua laluan transpilasi yang "
"tersedia.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We shall apply ```BasisTranslator``` and then "
"```Optimize1qGatesDecomposition``` passes to ensure that all the gates in "
"these circuits belong to the basis gate set. Using these two passes is "
"faster than the entire transpilation process, since other steps such as "
"routing and initial layout selection are not performed again.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita akan menggunakan laluan ```BasisTranslator``` dan kemudian "
"```Optimize1qGatesDecomposition``` untuk memastikan semua gate dalam circuit"
" ini tergolong dalam set gate asas. Menggunakan kedua-dua laluan ini lebih "
"pantas berbanding keseluruhan proses transpilasi, memandangkan langkah-"
"langkah lain seperti penghalaan dan pemilihan susun atur awal tidak "
"dilakukan semula.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 3: Execute using Qiskit primitives {#step-3-execute-using-qiskit-"
"primitives}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 3: Laksanakan menggunakan primitif Qiskit {#step-3-execute-using-"
"qiskit-primitives}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Input: Target circuits</li>\n"
"    <li>Output: Quasi-probability distributions</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"We use a `SamplerV2` primitive for execution of the cut circuits. We disable `dynamical decoupling` and `twirling` so that any improvement we obtain in the result will solely be due to effective application of gate cutting for this type of circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"<ul>\n"
"    <li>Input: Circuit sasaran</li>\n"
"    <li>Output: Taburan kuasi-kebarangkalian</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"Kita menggunakan primitif `SamplerV2` untuk melaksanakan circuit yang dipotong. Kita lumpuhkan `dynamical decoupling` dan `twirling` supaya sebarang peningkatan yang kita perolehi dalam keputusan adalah semata-mata disebabkan oleh penggunaan pemotongan gate yang berkesan untuk jenis circuit ini.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Now we shall submit the jobs using batch mode.\n"
msgstr "Sekarang kita akan hantar kerja menggunakan mod batch.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Step 4: Post-process and return result in desired classical format "
"{#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-format}"
msgstr ""
"Langkah 4: Pasca-proses dan kembalikan keputusan dalam format klasik yang "
"dikehendaki {#step-4-post-process-and-return-result-in-desired-classical-"
"format}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
