# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In summary, we calculated the average expectation values of weight-1 and "
"weight-2 Z-types observables for a periodic 1D chain of 109 qubits. In order"
" to do so, we\n"
msgstr ""
"Secara ringkasnya, kita telah mengira purata nilai jangkaan boleh ukur jenis"
" Z dengan berat-1 dan berat-2 untuk rantai 1D berkala dengan 109 Qubit. "
"Untuk melakukan ini, kita telah\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"created a virtual coupling map by adding a long range connectivity between "
"the first and the last qubits of the 1D chain, and transpiled the circuit.\n"
msgstr ""
"mencipta peta pasangan maya dengan menambah ketersambungan jarak jauh antara"
" Qubit pertama dan terakhir dalam rantai 1D, dan men-transpile circuit "
"tersebut.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"transpilation at this stage allowed us to avoid the overhead of transpiling "
"each subexperiment separately after cutting,\n"
msgstr ""
"transpilasi pada peringkat ini membolehkan kita mengelakkan overhead "
"transpilasi setiap subeksperimen secara berasingan selepas pemotongan,\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '    - '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"using virtual coupling map allowed us to avoid extra SWAP gates for the "
"2-qubit operation between the first and the last qubits.\n"
msgstr ""
"menggunakan peta pasangan maya membolehkan kita mengelakkan gate SWAP "
"tambahan untuk operasi 2-Qubit antara Qubit pertama dan terakhir.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"removed the long range connectivity from the transpiled circuit via gate "
"cutting.\n"
msgstr ""
"mengalih keluar ketersambungan jarak jauh dari circuit yang telah di-"
"transpile melalui pemotongan gate.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"converted the cut circuits into basis gate set by applying appropriate "
"transpilation passes.\n"
msgstr ""
"menukar circuit yang dipotong ke dalam set gate asas dengan menggunakan "
"laluan transpilasi yang sesuai.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"executed the cut circuits on IBM Quantum device using a `SamplerV2` "
"primitive.\n"
msgstr ""
"melaksanakan circuit yang dipotong pada peranti IBM Quantum menggunakan "
"primitif `SamplerV2`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"obtained the expectation value by reconstructing the outcomes of the cut "
"circuits.\n"
msgstr ""
"mendapatkan nilai jangkaan dengan membina semula hasil circuit yang "
"dipotong.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Inference {#inference}"
msgstr "Inferens {#inference}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We notice from the results that the average of the weight-1 $\\langle Z "
"\\rangle$ and weight-2 $\\langle ZZ \\rangle$ type observables are "
"significantly improved by cutting the periodic gates. Note that this study "
"does not include any error suppression or mitigation techniques. The "
"improvement observed is solely due to the proper usage of gate cutting for "
"this problem. The results could have been further improved by using the "
"mitigation and suppression techniques.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kita perhatikan daripada keputusan bahawa purata boleh ukur jenis $\\langle "
"Z \\rangle$ berat-1 dan $\\langle ZZ \\rangle$ berat-2 bertambah baik dengan"
" ketara melalui pemotongan gate berkala. Perlu diingat bahawa kajian ini "
"tidak memasukkan sebarang teknik pengurusan atau pengurangan ralat. "
"Peningkatan yang diperhatikan adalah semata-mata disebabkan oleh penggunaan "
"pemotongan gate yang betul untuk masalah ini. Keputusan boleh ditingkatkan "
"lagi dengan menggunakan teknik mitigasi dan pengurusan ralat.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This study shows an example of effectively using gate cutting to improve the"
" performance of computation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kajian ini menunjukkan contoh penggunaan pemotongan gate yang berkesan untuk"
" meningkatkan prestasi pengiraan.\n"

